  "text": "Niall is known as Niall of the Nine Hostages. He reigned in Connacht for twenty-three years. After that he succeeded to the throne at Tara. Some evidence suggests the historical Dathí was not a king at all. He may have been a warrior best known for a raid on the Continent. Later writers may have lifted his rank.",
